    "bell": {
      "text": "The Bellwarden tolls for the uncounted dead. Silence the bell.",
      "hint": "Break it — or finish the rites it has waited fifty years for: light both chapel braziers. Or, if you know whose names these are, read them aloud at the lectern.",
